    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31974" root="غضر" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَضِيرٌ</span></b>  <i>Soft,</i> or <i>tender;</i> (TA;) applied to a
plant, or herbage; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَضِرٌ</span></b> , and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَاضِرٌ</span></b> ;
(O, TA;) all in this sense: (TA:) or so the first,
applied to anything: (O, K, TA) or this signifies <i>moist, juicy,</i> or <i>fresh:</i> (AA, O:) and <i>i. q.</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَضِيرٌ</span> [<i>syn. with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخْضَرُ</span> i. e. <i>green</i>]. (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَضْرَآءُ</span>.

